Do you recognize a pupil, family name, address, building, photograph, or document? Are you researching related people or institutions? Contributions, questions, corrections, and proposals for collaboration are welcome.



Share family knowledge, photographs, documents, remembered stories, or information about former residences.



Help identify people and places, check transcriptions, locate sources, or contribute local knowledge.



Ask about the data and methods, propose reuse or collaboration, or point to related collections and research.



Report an error, ask how a conclusion was reached, or request clarification about a person or source.




The form below uses a placeholder Formspree endpoint. Replace REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_FORM_ID with your own endpoint, or replace this section with a link to a LimeSurvey, Nextcloud Forms, CryptPad, or other preferred form.


&lt;label for="name" class="form-label"&gt;Name&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;input type="text" class="form-control" id="name" name="name" required&gt;


&lt;label for="email" class="form-label"&gt;Email address&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;input type="email" class="form-control" id="email" name="email" required&gt;


&lt;label for="role" class="form-label"&gt;I am contacting you as …&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;select class="form-select" id="role" name="role"&gt;
  &lt;option&gt;Descendant or family member&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;option&gt;Volunteer&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;option&gt;Researcher&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;option&gt;Teacher or student&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;option&gt;Archivist or institution&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;option&gt;Other&lt;/option&gt;
&lt;/select&gt;


&lt;label for="subject" class="form-label"&gt;Person, place, photograph, or topic&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;input type="text" class="form-control" id="subject" name="subject"&gt;


&lt;label for="message" class="form-label"&gt;Message&lt;/label&gt;
&lt;textarea class="form-control" id="message" name="message" rows="8" required&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;


&lt;input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="privacy" required&gt;
&lt;label class="form-check-label" for="privacy"&gt;I have read the privacy information in the Impressum.&lt;/label&gt;


