When visitors use the contact form, the submitted name, email address, role, subject, and message are processed solely to answer the request and, where relevant, to assess a contribution to the research project. Specify:

the form provider and hosting location;
the legal basis for processing;
the retention period;
whether data is shared with third parties;
how contributors may request access, correction, or deletion.

Do not publish sensitive personal information or contributed family material without separate permission. Clarify how photographs and documents will be assessed, credited, licensed, stored, and potentially published.
